{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And Moses and Aaron and all the congregation of the children of Israel did to the Levites.</b> They performed on behalf of the Levites and for their assistance the matter of the shaving, the washing of the garments, and the offering." "<b>According to all that YHWH commanded Moses concerning the Levites.</b> As He commanded Moses that he should instruct the Levites to do." "<b>So the children of Israel did to them.</b> Israel bestirred themselves to act on their behalf, so that the will of their Maker would be fulfilled."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:05.201233655Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}